sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Dashboard as Admin Dashboard View
    participant AdminController as AdminController
    participant AdminTx as AdminTransactionController
    participant DB as Database

    Admin->>Dashboard: Open dashboard
    Dashboard->>AdminController: GET /Admin/Dashboard
    AdminController->>DB: Aggregate users, revenue, pending, overdue, feedback
    DB-->>AdminController: Summary data
    AdminController->>DB: Load recent transactions + latest feedback
    DB-->>AdminController: List data
    AdminController-->>Dashboard: Render dashboard

    Admin->>Dashboard: Open transaction list
    Dashboard->>AdminTx: GET /AdminTransaction
    AdminTx->>DB: Load all transactions with filters
    DB-->>AdminTx: Transaction list
    AdminTx-->>Dashboard: Render transaction screen
